WEBVTT

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.690
Saotome, I've almost got you. Bingo!

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:54.360
Would you like some nice iced barley tea?

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.340
That'll hit the spot, Kasumi!

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.070
Thank you Kasumi

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:58.780
Huh?

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:09.800
Ranma! He has no attention span whatsoever!

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:13.060
And there's still so much work to do!

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:18.630
Don't bother about him, Akane. I'll do Ranma's work as well.

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:22.850
Look at the nice guy act, Ryoga.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:25.530
You can have fun with me, Ryoga-baby!

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:31.090
Unfortunately for you I have a sense of responsibility.

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:36.360
Nice talk! You couldn't swim in the ocean even if you wanted to.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:39.620
It's so cold! It feels so refreshin'!

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:45.750
How dare you make jokes...

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:48.960
...right in front of Akane!

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:52.190
I won't have it!

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:00.050
You silly Ryoga! It's just a joke! Lighten up!

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.540
You've gone too far!

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:05.560
You dummy-dummy-dummy!

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:17.010
Come and get me if you can!

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:21.520
You brute!

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:25.730
Ranma...! You'll pay!

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:29.760
Ranma, stop it! Ryoga, ignore him!

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:33.010
Those two are such good friends!

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:49.230
No lollygagging! After you bus the tables, the restrooms await!

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:52.150
She works me like a slavemaster!

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:57.860
Mister Part-Time! You got something to say!?

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:02.490
Two ramen coming up. Catch!

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.740
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:06.630
Got it!

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:10.250
Shampoo go take ramen to Ranma!

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:13.500
Ranma! I come now!

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.550
W-Wait, Shampoo! I'd like to play in the sea, too...

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:23.800
You've got work to do!

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:29.420
"To my darling Ranma. Ukyo." It's finished!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:33.650
It's my best seafood Okomomiyaki special!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:35.900
Ryoga! Give me a break!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.070
Ranma-honey!

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:38.920
Wait, Ranma! I'm gonna close that mouth of yours for good!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:40.990
I was just kiddin'!

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.070
Can't you take a joke?

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:48.080
Ranma-honey! Perfect timing! Over here!

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.950
Ranma!

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:55.920
Ranma, come eat super deluxe ramen before it get cold!

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:59.610
What are you saying? Ranma's gonna eat the lunch I cooked!

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:02.220
What with you? I get here first!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.790
Ranma, prepare to die!

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:10.140
What the heck're you two doin'!? Get outta the way!!

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:19.060
Ranma-honey, You gotta choose.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:21.030
Right! Which one do you eat!?

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.380
Come on!

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:26.380
What that noise?

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:32.740
Happi is here!

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:35.040
So you're hauntin' us, y'old perverted ogre!

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.710
The beach is so wonderful!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:41.230
Even modest girls transform into bikini-clad goddesses!

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:45.340
The happiness of my youth once more!

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:47.260
Cut it out!

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:55.730
Ranma-honey, he gotcha.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.770
What a haul! What a haul!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:58.770
Wait, you old goat!

00:04:58.770 --> 00:04:59.770
Ranma- honey!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:00.280
Wait!

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:04.700
Oww...

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:08.660
Come 'n' get me!

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:11.610
You...

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:14.000
Hold it, gramps!

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:16.680
Hold it! Hold it! Hold it!

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:19.000
No way!

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:46.450
It'z so hottt...

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.140
Let's go to the beach!

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:51.030
We can't afford that.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:53.580
Greetings!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.830
This summer...

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:59.990
Tatewaki Kuno's private yacht, Binsense, will soon be complete!

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:01.000
In celebration...

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:05.840
I invite the pigtailed girl and Akane Tendo on a cruise!

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:08.840
Truly!?

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.040
Yeah, I'll go!

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.180
You've made me so happy!

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:13.710
Is what you say for real?

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:16.240
A yacht!? The lap of luxury!!

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:18.550
Not a bad idea.

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:21.550
If it's free, I'll grace you with my presence.

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:23.520
Happi, what about you?

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.690
Since he invited me, I can't refuse.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.470
Who invited all of you!?

00:06:40.990 --> 00:06:43.270
Nothing's better than the ocean in the summertime!

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:45.270
Yeah, it feels wonderful!

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:48.910
I'll give Kuno credit, this time.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:52.410
I wonder what distance we've traveled so far.

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:55.220
Good question. Let's ask Kuno.

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:58.390
Hey, Mr. Upperclassman!

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:00.230
Hey! Kuno!

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:04.560
Marvelous! Observe the vast expanse of sea!

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:08.110
How the ocean suits my manly countenance!

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:12.240
What's that?

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:16.470
Ranma-honey, they're reporting stormy weather on the radio.

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:18.340
Will we be okay?

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:20.640
We go back now?

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:23.260
What're you askin' me for?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:26.510
Fear not, pigtailed girl!

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:30.130
A storm or two is as nothing to Binsense!

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.870
Let the storm come!

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:47.840
Even the newest yachts can't stand up to mother nature.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:50.800
I feel sorry for him...

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:54.090
Do you think we can get back to Japan?

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.550
Wait up, old man!

00:07:58.550 --> 00:07:59.980
No way!

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:02.130
Gimme back my shirt!

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:06.840
My beloved Binsense, I'll restore you!

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:13.760
You geezer! Get down here!

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:16.140
No way!

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:26.120
Oww!

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.210
Oh, my!

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:31.530
K-Kuno? The mast...

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:36.630
What's that, pigtailed girl? Something wrong with the mast?

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:40.130
Mast-icated!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.940
Ranma!!

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:02.940
W-What is it, Akane!?

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:06.680
"What"!? You wrecked the boat! Do something!

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:08.150
Show some responsibility!

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:11.070
Why, me? The old letch broke it!

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.190
You did it, too!

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:17.560
Just a second! Didn't you just get this weird feelin'?

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:21.510
You can't change the subject on me! You always try that!

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:34.010
Will fixin' it make you happy?

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.510
Yeah! Fix it!

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:38.980
They're still at it. It must be love.

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:41.130
Right, Kasumi...

00:09:43.070 --> 00:09:45.020
Kasumi?

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:55.240
A peach...?

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.250
What!?

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.510
Kasumi's disappeared!?

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:09.250
She's been gone since noon.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:14.970
What could've happened? She's never left without telling us.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.950
Kasumi!

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:19.260
Akane...?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:23.660
Don't worry. Even if she's gone, she can't have left the island.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.590
She'll be back soon.

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:29.140
Can't you see how serious this situation is?

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:37.120
If Kasumi isn't back by dinner, we have to eat Akane's cookin'!

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:41.190
Then we'll all blow chunks and die...

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.080
I heard that.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:46.080
Worried about nothing at a time like this...

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:51.620
In any case, Kasumi is never this late.

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:55.630
This means that something must have happened to her!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:58.270
Daddy's gone bye-bye.

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:02.530
We have to split up and look for her before it gets dark.

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:04.730
You're right.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.300
This is my chance!

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:09.700
If I do my best and act manly in front of Akane...

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:12.170
...he'll say, "Ryoga, you're so reliable!"

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:15.650
Fear not, Akane! I'll be sure to find Kasumi and...

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.910
Kasumi! Kasumi!

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:24.100
Come, friend!

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:30.080
Kasumi!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.090
She's not over here, either!

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:33.960
I see...

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:39.010
Aw, man! Where could she be!? The island ain't that big.

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:42.510
Ranma, it's up to you now!

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.910
Gramps! Where d'ya think you're goin'!?

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:51.190
I'm getting hungry. So, I'll go to Shampoo's for some ramen...

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.660
Give me back my Shampoo!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.180
Wha-izzat for...

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:59.570
That's what I want to know.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:04.280
Son-in-law, have you seen Shampoo?

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.910
Shampoo is missin', too!?

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:12.680
She was supposed to be cooking dinner, but look...

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:16.380
As if she were spirited away.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.790
Ranma...? What is it?

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:23.110
Look at this.

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:24.970
A peach?

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.050
Kasumi!

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:27.880
Kasumi!

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:29.970
Kasumi!

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:34.050
We've searched this hard, and still haven't found her.

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:37.530
That means she must have been kidnapped!

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:41.200
That's crazy! This is a deserted island!

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:44.260
There's no one here to kidnap her!

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:46.100
You're naive, Ryoga!

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:50.870
A giant man-eating octopus is said to live in the South Seas!

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:53.320
Then Kasumi's been...

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.420
Help me...

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:04.550
That's awful! If we don't save her, she'll be eaten!

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.420
Curse that octopus!

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:09.890
Hey, what're you two doing out here?

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:11.100
It's you, Ukyo!

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:14.390
Kasumi is screaming for help while the octopuses are dancing...

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.400
What?

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:19.580
He's saying that Kasumi's been missing since noon.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:22.540
What's that? If Kasumi's gone...

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:27.270
...that means there's no one to cook for the Tendos!

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:30.080
It's my chance to get close to Ranma!

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.280
Ranma-honey! I'm coming...!

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:33.180
H-Hey! Wait, Ukyo!

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:37.750
If you go off by yourself, you'll wind up like Kasumi!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:54.270
Nabiki!

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:56.140
Dad, what's wrong!?

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:58.470
Did somethin' happen?

00:13:58.470 --> 00:13:59.910
It can't be...

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:01.940
Nabiki Tendo has vanished.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:02.480
Kuno!

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:04.620
Nabiki, too!?

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:08.990
She literally disappeared before our eyes! Ghostly, like this...

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.200
Kuno!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:14.470
Calm down. The fool just tripped.

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.460
Jeez! Scarin' us that like.

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:17.210
Honestly.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.290
Nabiki...!

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.290
What's that?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.300
A peach!?

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:22.430
Oh, my God!

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:23.960
Ukyo...

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.500
...disappeared!

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.650
Leaving only this!

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:32.240
Only lovely young women have disappeared.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:35.380
And it happened so suddenly, it could only mean...

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:36.560
...It's a warning.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.940
A warning? But from whom?

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:42.380
That, I do not know. But...

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:48.950
Kasumi, Nabiki, Shampoo, and Ukyo are gone. The next one is...

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:54.110
...me.

00:14:57.380 --> 00:14:59.270
Who'd kidnap a mummy like you!?

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:01.770
That's rude! I'm as feminine as the next woman!

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.920
Seriously, the next one they'd be after is...

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.340
Akane.

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.510
And one other person...

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.680
W-Wait a minute!

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:12.510
What're you thinkin'? Gimme a break!

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:17.040
Dammit! Lemme go! Why does this always happen to me?!

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:22.860
Could such crude bait be used to lure the malefactors?

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:26.860
Couldn't tell you. But it's worth a try.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.140
I wonder if it'll work?

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:35.530
Akane!

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.650
What's goin' on!?

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:40.170
Ryoga!!

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:40.870
Ryoga!

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:43.340
Strike the shadow!

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:45.290
Breaking Point!

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:54.420
So, you have seen through my shadow illusion!

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:55.550
My compliments!

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:58.090
The monkey talks!

00:15:58.090 --> 00:15:58.560
No way!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:01.510
Who are you calling a monkey!?

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.470
Uh-oh! I forgot all about my son-in-law!

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:07.400
Go away! Go away! Get outta here!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:09.620
Gimme some hot water!

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:14.530
Now it's my turn!

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:19.370
You're not gettin' away! Let's see what you really look like!

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:21.760
Dammit!

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:38.230
W-What's goin'...

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:42.240
Greetings. I am Togenkyo Island's Prince of Illusion...

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:43.500
Toma.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:47.440
A prince? Why's a brat like you usin' those tricky illusions!?

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:49.820
Where are my manners?

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:55.450
Is this better?

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:59.240
Hey! Are you the one who kidnapped my beautiful Shampoo!?

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.390
Indeed.

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:04.120
As I have with most of the young women shipwrecked on this isle.

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:09.030
I've invited them to Togenkyo Island. One will become my wife.

00:17:09.030 --> 00:17:13.510
How about you, Miss? You may also become a bridal candidate.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.300
Bridal candidate!? Don't make me laugh!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:20.010
He's right! Give back my sisters and my friends, right now!

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:24.540
Should you refuse, I must use the sacred Togenkyo water.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:27.310
It will turn you into a man.

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:32.400
Then no man will ever love you as a woman.

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:33.780
Sarutoru.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.260
Yes, Lord!

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:38.070
Here, Lord.

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.360
What's he doin'!?

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:42.470
Something about becoming a man...

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:47.580
C-Can it be!?

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:55.840
Incredible!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:56.940
It's a man!

00:17:56.940 --> 00:17:58.510
If we had that water...

00:17:58.510 --> 00:17:59.590
...We could be cured!

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:04.100
Do as I say! Do you want to become a man forever?

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:06.120
Damn straight!

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:07.270
Gimme that water!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.670
Silence! You brutes!

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.390
I have no business with men!

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:16.430
Feel my ultimate technique...

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:18.660
Chaotic Mirage Attack!

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:25.370
Ranma!

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:36.130
A-Akane!!

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.380
Son-in-law! Son-in-law!

00:18:48.150 --> 00:18:50.270
Get up!

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:52.730
That's cold!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.370
What happened to me!

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:56.100
You're finally awake.

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:59.110
I-I remember fightin' that little Toma brat...

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.410
Hey, I'm okay!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:04.650
Exactly. Those flames were nothing but illusion.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:10.470
Then everythin' that went on yesterday was just a mirage...?

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:14.150
Maybe not...

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:17.130
Take a look at that, son-in-law!

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:20.190
That island wasn't there yesterday!

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:22.840
That is the legendary Togenkyo Island!

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:25.470
And that's where that Toma kid is...

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:26.470
Ranma!

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:29.040
Not only did you allow them to kidnap Kasumi and Nabiki...

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:32.110
...you let them kidnap Akane, too!

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:38.240
Don't worry, Father! I, Ryoga Hibiki, will bring Akane back!

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:41.570
When did I become your father?

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:44.120
I shall go too, Madam Crone!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:45.780
Who are you talking to?

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:50.890
Son-in-law, Shampoo's kidnapping is your responsibility.

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:53.260
I'd go to that island anyway.

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:56.810
That water can change me back into a man!

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:01.380
Hey, you jerks!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.840
Idiots.

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:11.690
Pigtailed girl! You're safe!

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:18.150
Upperclassman Kuno, there's teensy favor I'd like to ask...

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.030
A favor?

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:22.950
This emergency lifeboat oughta be enough to get to that island.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:27.800
I'm gonna get my hands on that water! No matter what!

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:53.230
We have arrived.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:57.570
W-What in the world!?

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:05.330
This is the chamber where Prince Toma's bridal candidates tarry.

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:08.300
Candidates? All of these girls are candidates?

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:10.330
Indeed.

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:14.330
Make yourself at home.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:18.340
A-Akane!?

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:19.010
Ukyo!?

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:21.230
So they got you, too!

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:24.340
Then all these girls are...?

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:30.350
Yeah! All these girls were kidnapped from nearby islands!

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:34.230
So we weren't the only ones kidnapped...

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:39.000
I don't want a shotgun wedding with some guy I don't know!

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:40.670
What'll I do, Akane?

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:44.770
Don't worry! Ranma and the others will rescue us. I know it!

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:48.660
Ranma will? That's right! He loves me so much!

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:53.830
It's not like he's only going to rescue you!

00:21:56.600 --> 00:21:58.730
He'll come!

00:22:14.950 --> 00:22:17.370
Looks like that's the main entrance.

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:20.510
That brat! He won't get off so easy, this time!

00:22:20.510 --> 00:22:21.510
What'll we do?

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:24.740
Whadda ya' think? We're gonna bust down the front gate!

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:25.440
Let's go!

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:27.980
Halt!

00:22:27.980 --> 00:22:32.630
Son-in-law, have you forgotten that Shampoo is a hostage?

00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:35.890
Oh yeah.

00:22:35.890 --> 00:22:40.830
At times like this, stealth is the proper choice.

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:41.760
Of course!

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:45.800
The wisdom of age is always the rage.

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:46.570
What? What is that?

00:22:46.570 --> 00:22:48.630
Oh no! They've found us!

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:53.430
Come 'n' get me!

00:22:56.220 --> 00:23:00.410
Gramps! I take my eyes off you for a second... Where'd you go?

00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:05.080
I heard there were loads of bridal candidates in there.

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:07.620
I wanted to see for myself.

00:23:07.620 --> 00:23:08.290
Intruder!

00:23:08.290 --> 00:23:09.290
Don't lose him!

00:23:09.290 --> 00:23:12.160
Ranma, this fight is yours!

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:17.710
What!?

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:22.370
Someone's fainted!

00:23:22.370 --> 00:23:23.800
It's a girl!

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:28.690
If Prince Toma finds out we let her escape, we're in for it!

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:31.590
One-two. One-two.

00:23:42.640 --> 00:23:44.270
This is the last girl.

00:23:44.270 --> 00:23:45.520
Well done.

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:48.930
How now? Haven't we met somewhere before, Miss?

00:23:48.930 --> 00:23:51.430
Uh-oh.

00:23:51.430 --> 00:23:54.490
Oh, dear! You're not tryin' to pick me up, are you?

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:59.420
No, I uh... I feel as though we've met somewhere before.

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:02.170
Pardon me...

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:03.920
Stop!

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:09.420
Prince Toma will see you shortly. Please pick an appropriate dress.

00:24:11.470 --> 00:24:14.300
I'll be ever-so-pretty for him.

00:24:18.410 --> 00:24:21.430
I'm impressed! Look at all the clothes!

00:24:21.430 --> 00:24:23.030
I agree!

00:24:23.030 --> 00:24:27.430
He must have looted them from the surrounding villages.

00:24:27.430 --> 00:24:28.900
When'd you get here?

00:24:28.900 --> 00:24:33.040
Son-in-law! Shall I chose something pretty for you?

00:24:33.040 --> 00:24:35.760
That'll help. Thanks, Granny.

00:24:40.730 --> 00:24:42.860
I'm ready!

00:24:51.810 --> 00:24:55.390
This way. I'll guide you to your audience.

00:24:56.580 --> 00:24:58.300
This way?

00:24:58.300 --> 00:25:00.400
Stupid heels; I can't walk!

00:25:00.400 --> 00:25:03.020
Patience, son-in-law...

00:25:13.270 --> 00:25:17.530
Wow! That little pipsqueak's hoggin' so many girls!

00:25:18.170 --> 00:25:20.830
Oh, my! Isn't that Ranma?

00:25:21.470 --> 00:25:22.700
Ranma!

00:25:24.370 --> 00:25:26.160
Ranma!

00:25:26.160 --> 00:25:27.930
Ranma come and rescue Shampoo!

00:25:27.930 --> 00:25:29.400
Get offa me. Hey!

00:25:29.400 --> 00:25:32.500
Ranma really do love Shampoo!

00:25:32.500 --> 00:25:35.010
No! I just...

00:25:35.490 --> 00:25:38.720
You're both girls! Behave yourselves!

00:25:39.360 --> 00:25:41.640
Ranma-honey, over here!

00:25:41.640 --> 00:25:43.880
Ranma, welcome!

00:25:43.880 --> 00:25:45.640
What's goin' on here?

00:25:45.640 --> 00:25:48.770
I thought that squirt'd have you in chains or somethin'.

00:25:48.770 --> 00:25:53.330
Well, it seems we are here for an arranged marriage.

00:25:54.270 --> 00:25:58.420
So they treat us like we're some kinda princesses!

00:25:58.420 --> 00:26:00.620
Princesses?

00:26:00.620 --> 00:26:02.630
That's right!

00:26:02.630 --> 00:26:08.070
These men will do anything I ask! I'm having the time of my life.

00:26:08.070 --> 00:26:09.200
Gimme some oolong tea.

00:26:09.200 --> 00:26:11.140
Yes, ma'am.

00:26:11.140 --> 00:26:14.440
Nabiki! You're overdoing it a little!

00:26:14.440 --> 00:26:18.220
They're serious about this arranged marriage.

00:26:19.640 --> 00:26:21.960
Ladies!

00:26:23.040 --> 00:26:27.530
The prince of Togenkyo Island, Prince Toma has arrived!

00:26:38.450 --> 00:26:40.000
Oh, dear. He's younger than me.

00:26:40.000 --> 00:26:42.670
Not just younger. He's tiny!

00:26:42.670 --> 00:26:44.660
He needs about ten years to ripen.

00:26:44.660 --> 00:26:47.370
Doesn't matter to me.

00:26:47.370 --> 00:26:52.390
If I got him to choose me, I'd become the queen of the island!

00:26:52.970 --> 00:26:54.920
This may be my chance!

00:26:54.920 --> 00:26:59.870
Nabiki! What are you saying? We have to think about escape!

00:27:00.470 --> 00:27:01.840
Where you go!?

00:27:01.840 --> 00:27:03.720
Ranma!

00:27:06.610 --> 00:27:07.960
Hey, Prince Toma!

00:27:07.960 --> 00:27:09.730
W-Who are you?

00:27:09.730 --> 00:27:13.830
You couldn't have forgotten! I'm your fiancée!

00:27:13.830 --> 00:27:14.710
Fiancée?

00:27:14.710 --> 00:27:16.780
I do not recall having a fiancée!

00:27:16.780 --> 00:27:18.600
You're awful!

00:27:18.600 --> 00:27:23.580
We've been engaged for 13 years and 3 months!

00:27:23.580 --> 00:27:27.750
And I've been savin' myself for you all this time!

00:27:27.750 --> 00:27:30.680
I know nothing of it!

00:27:30.680 --> 00:27:35.290
If you truly wish to be my bride...

00:27:35.290 --> 00:27:38.960
You may enter the martial arts marriage contest as well.

00:27:38.960 --> 00:27:41.430
Marital arts marriage contest!?

00:27:41.430 --> 00:27:46.600
The martial arts marriage contest will now commence!

00:27:46.600 --> 00:27:51.770
The one who wins the contest will become Prince Toma's bride!

00:27:51.770 --> 00:27:54.320
I'm gonna win this contest!

00:27:54.930 --> 00:27:56.610
What are you talking about!?

00:27:56.610 --> 00:27:58.780
The first point to check!

00:27:58.780 --> 00:28:03.650
Toma's bride must demonstrate both grace and patience!

00:28:03.650 --> 00:28:06.790
The contest is to move rice grains from one plate to another!

00:28:06.790 --> 00:28:08.920
I'm not here for phys-ed.

00:28:08.920 --> 00:28:10.190
Shampoo laugh!

00:28:10.190 --> 00:28:13.060
Why do I gotta enter some stupid contest?

00:28:13.060 --> 00:28:17.030
I must give one of these to any who refuse to participate.

00:28:17.030 --> 00:28:17.880
What's that?

00:28:17.880 --> 00:28:22.640
First, there is the dress rental, make-over fee, food, butler's fee...

00:28:22.640 --> 00:28:26.110
Everything included, it comes to 103,000 yen.

00:28:28.460 --> 00:28:30.180
You mean no is free?

00:28:30.180 --> 00:28:33.780
Those who do not participate must settle their accounts.

00:28:33.780 --> 00:28:35.480
We have no choice!

00:28:35.480 --> 00:28:37.820
On your marks...

00:28:37.820 --> 00:28:40.150
Get set...

00:28:43.740 --> 00:28:47.460
With the speed of my Chestnuts Roastin' on an Open Fire attack...

00:28:47.460 --> 00:28:50.180
...this is a piece of cake!

00:28:51.820 --> 00:28:54.470
I'm done!

00:28:54.470 --> 00:28:57.460
Whatcha think? Aren't I good?

00:28:57.860 --> 00:28:59.980
I'm number one!

00:29:01.690 --> 00:29:04.720
I did it! Now that gourd's all mine!

00:29:04.720 --> 00:29:07.630
That wasn't fun for me at all.

00:29:08.270 --> 00:29:10.390
Yes, Lord.

00:29:11.000 --> 00:29:12.750
Next!

00:29:12.750 --> 00:29:15.720
H-Hey, I won that contest!

00:29:15.720 --> 00:29:18.090
It was boring, so it doesn't count.

00:29:18.090 --> 00:29:20.830
Doesn't count? You can't do that!

00:29:20.830 --> 00:29:23.900
You'd better hurry back. The next contest is starting.

00:29:23.900 --> 00:29:26.730
...contest in the traditional arts!

00:29:26.730 --> 00:29:29.570
Just watch me!

00:29:29.570 --> 00:29:31.080
The final flower arrangement wins!

00:29:31.080 --> 00:29:33.550
Let it begin!

00:29:35.890 --> 00:29:38.020
This can't be...

00:29:39.600 --> 00:29:41.580
It a man-eating plant!

00:29:41.580 --> 00:29:43.930
We can't arrange this!

00:29:44.510 --> 00:29:46.800
Help me!

00:29:48.040 --> 00:29:49.890
Arrange it!?

00:29:49.890 --> 00:29:52.060
I can do that!

00:30:04.890 --> 00:30:09.880
The Saotome School of Anything- Goes Flower Arrangement.

00:30:09.880 --> 00:30:11.040
Brava! Brava!

00:30:11.040 --> 00:30:13.190
Ranma!

00:30:14.000 --> 00:30:17.680
You idiot! What are you thinking? Honestly!

00:30:17.680 --> 00:30:19.880
Hurry up and rescue me!

00:30:19.880 --> 00:30:23.920
Hey, Akane! So there you are! Whatcha doin' up there?

00:30:23.920 --> 00:30:25.190
Next!

00:30:25.190 --> 00:30:28.180
Y-Yes, Lord. Prepare the next event!

00:30:29.470 --> 00:30:32.630
Hold it a second! You sayin' this doesn't count either?

00:30:32.630 --> 00:30:37.060
It wouldn't be much fun if a girl won that easily, would it?

00:30:37.060 --> 00:30:38.470
What!?

00:30:38.470 --> 00:30:41.140
Toma's bride must be healthy and long-lived.

00:30:41.140 --> 00:30:44.570
We'll conduct a short marathon to test this.

00:30:44.570 --> 00:30:46.960
What's that?

00:30:50.110 --> 00:30:54.120
C'mon! Mice are nothin' to be scared about.

00:30:54.120 --> 00:30:57.120
Quit whinin' like a bunch of cats!

00:30:59.810 --> 00:31:01.880
I-I can't stand CATS!

00:31:09.250 --> 00:31:11.380
This way! Follow me!

00:31:12.260 --> 00:31:15.340
He may be odd, but he is our master.

00:31:15.340 --> 00:31:18.350
His lecherous skills can come in handy.

00:31:18.350 --> 00:31:20.600
Guess so.

00:31:23.370 --> 00:31:25.950
No doubt about it! This is the place!

00:31:25.950 --> 00:31:29.960
Akane and the other girls are beyond that door!

00:31:29.960 --> 00:31:30.690
Right!

00:31:30.690 --> 00:31:31.920
I'll join the fray!

00:31:31.920 --> 00:31:32.760
Akane!

00:31:32.760 --> 00:31:33.620
Shampoo!

00:31:36.010 --> 00:31:40.210
Anybody call for a martial artist? No? Then excuse us...

00:31:42.380 --> 00:31:43.640
Why me?

00:31:43.640 --> 00:31:45.630
Stay back! Stay back!

00:31:51.000 --> 00:31:52.980
What a stupid girl!

00:31:52.980 --> 00:31:56.990
Prince Toma, isn't it time to choose your bride?

00:31:58.170 --> 00:32:02.890
Not yet. It's been so long since I've seen such a good show!

00:32:02.890 --> 00:32:05.310
See how absurd she looks!

00:32:07.750 --> 00:32:10.860
I hope poor Ranma is all right...

00:32:10.860 --> 00:32:15.500
Ranma! Back on your feet! Give 'em one for us, too!

00:32:15.500 --> 00:32:16.030
Ranma!

00:32:16.030 --> 00:32:17.400
Ranma-honey!

00:32:17.400 --> 00:32:20.510
This ain't enough ta' put me out...

00:32:20.510 --> 00:32:23.580
Oh, Ranma... Why are you so determined to win?

00:32:23.580 --> 00:32:26.010
...the obstacle cooking race! On your marks...

00:32:26.010 --> 00:32:27.170
Get set...

00:32:30.040 --> 00:32:31.580
Where... are we?

00:32:31.580 --> 00:32:33.550
That's... Akane!

00:32:33.550 --> 00:32:35.740
Kasumi! Nabiki!

00:32:34.740 --> 00:32:35.760
Ryoga!

00:32:35.760 --> 00:32:37.060
Oh, it's Father.

00:32:37.060 --> 00:32:40.060
What are you people doing here?

00:32:40.060 --> 00:32:42.060
We hit the jackpot!

00:32:42.060 --> 00:32:43.350
Sure looks like it!

00:32:43.350 --> 00:32:46.030
Behave yourselves in front of Prince Toma!

00:32:46.030 --> 00:32:48.070
Don't put on airs, you bride-nappers!

00:32:48.070 --> 00:32:50.360
Give me back Akane!

00:32:50.790 --> 00:32:54.510
Interesting. It's another show for my amusement.

00:32:54.510 --> 00:32:57.280
Shall we indulge them?

00:32:57.280 --> 00:32:58.120
Take them!

00:32:58.120 --> 00:32:58.780
Saotome!

00:32:58.780 --> 00:32:59.500
Shall we!?

00:32:59.500 --> 00:33:00.360
I don't like it but...

00:33:00.360 --> 00:33:01.440
For Shampoo!

00:33:01.440 --> 00:33:02.420
Let's go!

00:33:13.580 --> 00:33:16.030
It's turning into a real brawl!

00:33:16.030 --> 00:33:18.600
Ranma-honey, what'll we do!?

00:33:18.600 --> 00:33:21.020
I ain't gonna lose this!

00:33:22.890 --> 00:33:23.800
I'm done!

00:33:23.800 --> 00:33:27.670
Saotome School of Cookin'! Deluxe Rice Omelet...

00:33:27.670 --> 00:33:30.860
This is an emergency here! Help us out, boy!

00:33:32.260 --> 00:33:34.660
That's great! Keep it up!

00:33:37.000 --> 00:33:38.070
Who are you?

00:33:44.340 --> 00:33:45.920
W-What have you done?

00:33:45.920 --> 00:33:46.990
Stop this right now!

00:33:46.990 --> 00:33:52.100
Using women just to relieve your boredom! You're the lowest!

00:33:52.100 --> 00:33:55.270
If you want to get married, you'd better show some sincerity.

00:33:55.270 --> 00:33:58.970
Quiet! You cannot speak to the Prince that way!

00:33:58.970 --> 00:34:01.120
What is your name?

00:34:02.160 --> 00:34:03.470
Akane Tendo.

00:34:03.470 --> 00:34:06.010
Akane?

00:34:06.010 --> 00:34:10.980
Fine. Sarutoru, I've decided. This girl will be my bride!

00:34:10.980 --> 00:34:12.250
Very good, Lord.

00:34:12.250 --> 00:34:12.850
H-Hey!

00:34:12.850 --> 00:34:13.850
Attention!

00:34:13.850 --> 00:34:18.940
The winner of the Martial Arts Marriage Contest is Akane Tendo!

00:34:19.410 --> 00:34:20.930
A-Akane!?

00:34:20.930 --> 00:34:23.030
Saotome, what is this?

00:34:23.030 --> 00:34:24.160
I'm in the dark, too!

00:34:24.160 --> 00:34:26.030
How Akane win?

00:34:26.030 --> 00:34:27.930
Did she bewitch him somehow?

00:34:27.930 --> 00:34:29.170
You've gotta be kiddin'...!

00:34:29.170 --> 00:34:31.100
B-But I didn't mean...

00:34:31.100 --> 00:34:33.340
I've never felt this way before!

00:34:33.340 --> 00:34:34.810
Understand, Sarutoru?

00:34:34.810 --> 00:34:38.680
Well understood, Lord! But about the rest of the candidates...?

00:34:38.680 --> 00:34:42.050
It doesn't matter. Take them as brides for you and the guards.

00:34:42.050 --> 00:34:44.080
Inform the men.

00:34:44.080 --> 00:34:47.490
What a wonderful thought! Everyone will be so appreciative!

00:34:47.490 --> 00:34:49.910
Everyone! He just agreed!

00:34:51.080 --> 00:34:52.900
Wonton! We must hurry!

00:34:55.080 --> 00:34:55.460
W-What's...!?

00:34:55.460 --> 00:34:56.260
Kasumi!

00:34:56.260 --> 00:34:58.680
Father! Father!

00:35:01.200 --> 00:35:03.580
This is excellent, Wonton!

00:35:09.230 --> 00:35:11.040
Sh-Shampoo...!

00:35:15.200 --> 00:35:17.330
I'm speechless.

00:35:22.870 --> 00:35:26.060
They love their work. Let's go, Akane.

00:35:26.060 --> 00:35:28.460
Wait!

00:35:28.460 --> 00:35:29.460
Ranma!

00:35:29.460 --> 00:35:31.200
You again?

00:35:31.200 --> 00:35:35.940
Toma, listen closely. It's your last chance to change your mind.

00:35:35.940 --> 00:35:37.670
What!?

00:35:37.670 --> 00:35:42.310
She's a bad cook, no sex appeal, ugly, waistless, can't swim...

00:35:42.310 --> 00:35:46.620
...a tomboy, violent, and the clumsiest woman in the country!

00:35:47.430 --> 00:35:49.510
Before you consider Akane...

00:35:49.510 --> 00:35:52.950
Don't you think I'd be much better...

00:35:52.950 --> 00:35:55.950
What's with you!? I thought you came to rescue me!

00:35:55.950 --> 00:35:58.720
And you just compliment yourself, like a complete jerk!

00:35:58.720 --> 00:36:02.930
You should talk! Dressed up like some Roman princess!

00:36:02.930 --> 00:36:06.310
Don't try to pretend that you don't like it...

00:36:09.390 --> 00:36:13.370
If you feel that way, then I don't care what you do!

00:36:13.370 --> 00:36:15.670
You and I are through!

00:36:15.670 --> 00:36:17.480
Come on, let's go.

00:36:19.160 --> 00:36:21.610
Hold on tightly, now...

00:36:21.610 --> 00:36:23.760
Wait!

00:36:36.450 --> 00:36:39.380
Kasumi! Nabiki!

00:36:40.590 --> 00:36:42.710
Akane!

00:36:46.020 --> 00:36:49.260
You little brat! This ain't over yet!

00:37:06.440 --> 00:37:08.390
Do you like my chambers?

00:37:08.390 --> 00:37:10.540
Yeah. What's that?

00:37:14.250 --> 00:37:16.330
That's a portrait of me and my mother.

00:37:16.330 --> 00:37:17.800
Your mother?

00:37:17.800 --> 00:37:20.750
She passed away shortly after I was born...

00:37:20.750 --> 00:37:24.300
Sometimes, I wonder what sort of woman she was.

00:37:24.300 --> 00:37:26.340
So your mother, too...

00:37:26.340 --> 00:37:27.910
You lost yours, too?

00:37:27.910 --> 00:37:31.600
Yeah, but I have my father, and sisters...

00:37:32.340 --> 00:37:34.890
Oh, I'm not lonely at all.

00:37:34.890 --> 00:37:39.590
Everyone on the island is just like family. And...

00:37:39.590 --> 00:37:42.260
...now I have you.

00:37:42.260 --> 00:37:44.400
Toma...

00:37:44.400 --> 00:37:47.780
I feel good with you around. Really.

00:37:47.780 --> 00:37:52.790
Come on. There are lots of girls nicer and prettier than me...

00:37:52.790 --> 00:37:56.780
The island's magical spring turns anything it touches into a man.

00:37:56.780 --> 00:38:01.180
Since ancient times, only boys have been born here.

00:38:01.180 --> 00:38:03.180
It's a cursed island.

00:38:03.180 --> 00:38:06.380
Water that turns you into a man...?

00:38:32.030 --> 00:38:33.140
Is that...?

00:38:33.140 --> 00:38:38.580
The spring. And because of it, we must find our women elsewhere.

00:38:39.470 --> 00:38:40.620
Toma...?

00:38:40.620 --> 00:38:45.490
But even so, it's a sacred spring that protects the island.

00:38:45.490 --> 00:38:48.690
Akane, this must remain our secret.

00:38:48.690 --> 00:38:51.260
You will stay with me, won't you Akane?

00:38:51.260 --> 00:38:54.810
I can't. I have a fiancé.

00:38:55.190 --> 00:38:56.320
A fiancé?

00:38:56.320 --> 00:38:58.090
Do you love him?

00:38:58.090 --> 00:39:01.640
No way! Who could love such an insensitive, inconsiderate...

00:39:01.640 --> 00:39:05.580
And it was just an arrangement between our fathers...

00:39:05.580 --> 00:39:09.210
Then there is nothing to worry about.

00:39:09.210 --> 00:39:13.120
If he comes after you, I'll take care of him!

00:39:16.470 --> 00:39:17.690
What is it!?

00:39:17.690 --> 00:39:19.370
The invaders have escaped!

00:39:19.370 --> 00:39:23.380
Recapture them at any cost! Let no one escape!

00:39:27.450 --> 00:39:31.390
Don't worry. I'll be back soon, so wait for me.

00:39:34.330 --> 00:39:36.660
What am I doing here?

00:39:45.500 --> 00:39:46.750
This is a maze!

00:39:46.750 --> 00:39:49.820
We gotta split up and search for them separately.

00:39:49.820 --> 00:39:50.660
You're right!

00:39:50.660 --> 00:39:51.300
Then...

00:39:52.980 --> 00:39:54.540
W-What about us...?

00:39:54.540 --> 00:39:55.400
This way!

00:39:57.910 --> 00:40:01.370
Why, you... You... You... You... You... You...

00:40:04.190 --> 00:40:07.760
If you want to marry me, we got to talk about engagement gifts.

00:40:09.130 --> 00:40:13.760
We're talking huge diamonds, or gold bullion.

00:40:19.640 --> 00:40:21.520
Who asked for YOU!?

00:40:26.910 --> 00:40:28.040
You okay?

00:40:28.040 --> 00:40:30.630
I'm fine, but Kuno-baby here...

00:40:30.630 --> 00:40:33.980
Aww, jeez. Upperclassman Kuno. You okay?

00:40:36.290 --> 00:40:37.640
You overgrown dog-man!

00:40:37.640 --> 00:40:39.640
You dare mock Tatewaki Kuno!

00:40:39.640 --> 00:40:42.250
You shall be punished! Prepare yourself!

00:40:43.090 --> 00:40:45.860
I claim the first attack!

00:40:47.500 --> 00:40:49.550
This guy's good!

00:40:55.840 --> 00:40:59.360
So much for him. Guess I'll have to take you on.

00:40:59.360 --> 00:41:01.130
Let's go, Jumbo!

00:41:01.130 --> 00:41:02.480
Hold...

00:41:02.480 --> 00:41:06.980
The battle has just begun! Here I come, dog-man!

00:41:15.560 --> 00:41:19.120
Kuno-baby. You're so hopeless.

00:41:21.620 --> 00:41:22.870
Shake.

00:41:22.870 --> 00:41:24.180
Hey, Nabiki...

00:41:24.180 --> 00:41:25.760
Shake. Shake.

00:41:27.810 --> 00:41:29.750
That's a good boy!

00:41:29.750 --> 00:41:31.900
Next, stand up!

00:41:32.880 --> 00:41:33.830
Lay down!

00:41:33.830 --> 00:41:37.860
What a good boy you are! I'll give you a reward...

00:41:37.860 --> 00:41:39.100
Here y'go!

00:41:39.100 --> 00:41:41.140
Now go fetch! Here!

00:41:49.590 --> 00:41:50.880
What was that?

00:41:50.880 --> 00:41:53.660
I'm good at playing with pets.

00:41:54.870 --> 00:41:58.730
Can't stay. Nabiki, look after Kuno, will you?

00:41:59.900 --> 00:42:03.360
You're such a mess. Kuno... Kuno-baby...

00:42:04.680 --> 00:42:06.360
Curse you... Where'd the dog-man go!?

00:42:06.360 --> 00:42:08.710
He dropped out of sight.

00:42:09.510 --> 00:42:14.090
He must have run in the face of my sword! The fool!

00:42:16.750 --> 00:42:19.090
I guess we can leave it at that.

00:42:19.090 --> 00:42:21.890
Akane! Kasumi!

00:42:21.890 --> 00:42:22.370
Answer me!

00:42:22.370 --> 00:42:24.140
Hello, Father.

00:42:24.140 --> 00:42:26.290
Kasumi!? You're SAFE!

00:42:27.770 --> 00:42:28.780
Thank goodness!

00:42:28.780 --> 00:42:30.720
Kasumi, who is this man?

00:42:30.720 --> 00:42:32.750
He's a guard on this island.

00:42:32.750 --> 00:42:35.610
He's asked me to cook dinner for him.

00:42:36.910 --> 00:42:39.950
Kasumi! Then fix him your finest meal!

00:42:40.910 --> 00:42:42.580
I will, Father.

00:42:44.520 --> 00:42:47.630
Shampoo has no want to date you!

00:42:47.630 --> 00:42:49.870
I see. Then you leave me no choice.

00:42:49.870 --> 00:42:52.500
W-What you...?

00:42:52.500 --> 00:42:57.510
You take me by force? You not underestimate Amazon woman!

00:42:57.510 --> 00:43:00.640
An Amazon? I like you even more!

00:43:01.730 --> 00:43:05.680
I have a man already! Strong man who defeat even Shampoo!

00:43:05.680 --> 00:43:07.230
Shampoo...!

00:43:07.230 --> 00:43:09.230
Ranm...

00:43:10.190 --> 00:43:12.190
I've found the right place!

00:43:12.190 --> 00:43:14.460
So he is your strong man?

00:43:14.460 --> 00:43:16.490
Let us fight, then...

00:43:16.490 --> 00:43:18.810
H-He not the one!

00:43:19.570 --> 00:43:23.670
You think you can defeat me? You have courage! Let's fight!

00:43:23.670 --> 00:43:25.440
Mousse! You wait...!

00:43:25.440 --> 00:43:28.140
After I defeat you, I shall reclaim Shampoo!

00:43:28.140 --> 00:43:32.540
Agreed! But should I be the victor, I will wed that woman!

00:43:32.540 --> 00:43:35.950
Stop stupid jokes! No decide for Shampoo!

00:43:35.950 --> 00:43:40.630
Fear not, Shampoo! I shall surely win!

00:43:42.050 --> 00:43:42.760
I have you now!

00:43:42.760 --> 00:43:45.700
Where is he? Where did he go?

00:43:51.400 --> 00:43:52.460
Well parried!

00:43:52.460 --> 00:43:53.610
Naturally!

00:43:55.890 --> 00:43:59.610
Whoever win has nothing to do with Shampoo.

00:44:02.660 --> 00:44:06.950
You have some skill. Therefore, I'll fight with all my might.

00:44:06.950 --> 00:44:09.250
Take my FEATHER BLIZZARD!

00:44:10.340 --> 00:44:12.210
What? Oh, no!

00:44:12.870 --> 00:44:14.210
Mousse! What you doing!?

00:44:14.210 --> 00:44:16.700
So? Do you admit defeat?

00:44:18.050 --> 00:44:18.620
Never!

00:44:18.620 --> 00:44:20.020
I've no choice...

00:44:20.020 --> 00:44:21.880
Mousse! Shampoo help!

00:44:26.480 --> 00:44:30.010
Well! Do you see my strength, Masked Man?

00:44:31.730 --> 00:44:35.730
You'll regret forcing me into an all-out fight!

00:44:39.700 --> 00:44:42.530
Your face is not scary no more!

00:44:43.070 --> 00:44:47.070
S-Shampoo! I-I'm trying not to laugh here...

00:44:49.340 --> 00:44:51.290
Sorry! I don't have anything against you...

00:44:51.290 --> 00:44:54.760
Mousse! You not have right to talk!

00:44:54.760 --> 00:44:58.920
That's nerve! Neither of you will leave here alive!

00:44:58.920 --> 00:45:00.670
Prepare to die! First, the woman!

00:45:00.670 --> 00:45:02.220
Shampoo!

00:45:04.590 --> 00:45:08.010
You can't move now! I've stuck you in your nerve centers!

00:45:08.010 --> 00:45:11.060
Well, woman? If you become my bride, I'll spare your life!

00:45:11.060 --> 00:45:14.580
Shampoo rather die than marry you!

00:45:14.580 --> 00:45:16.950
Very well! I'll grant your wish!

00:45:16.950 --> 00:45:18.570
Hold it!

00:45:19.870 --> 00:45:22.640
Don't lay a finger on Shampoo!

00:45:23.700 --> 00:45:25.920
Absurd! How can you move?

00:45:25.920 --> 00:45:27.740
You half-dead fool! I'll finish you off!

00:45:31.540 --> 00:45:35.010
Inconceivable! Don't you feel pain!?

00:45:35.850 --> 00:45:36.790
Mousse!

00:45:42.710 --> 00:45:45.430
S-Shampoo, I won!

00:45:45.720 --> 00:45:46.800
Mousse!

00:45:52.470 --> 00:45:55.000
S-Shampoo is... my bride...

00:45:56.440 --> 00:45:59.930
Mousse! You truly a silly man.

00:46:00.900 --> 00:46:02.390
Akane!

00:46:02.390 --> 00:46:03.860
It's you, Ryoga!

00:46:03.860 --> 00:46:05.100
Ukyo!

00:46:05.100 --> 00:46:06.100
It's only you.

00:46:06.100 --> 00:46:06.930
See you later.

00:46:06.930 --> 00:46:10.870
Ryoga! You're here, so you might as well rescue me, you traitor!

00:46:10.870 --> 00:46:13.450
Sorry, I'm too busy looking for Akane.

00:46:13.450 --> 00:46:16.270
Can't you see what's going on here?

00:46:16.270 --> 00:46:21.080
What do you think happens when a girl is alone with a beast!

00:46:21.080 --> 00:46:24.520
You're not my first choice, but you're all I've got here!

00:46:24.520 --> 00:46:26.340
I'm asking nicely!

00:46:26.770 --> 00:46:30.150
When were you nice? This is all your own fault, anyway!

00:46:30.150 --> 00:46:31.350
I warned you!

00:46:31.350 --> 00:46:35.290
You keep harping on the past! And you call yourself a man!

00:46:35.290 --> 00:46:37.350
How about acting a little more manly?

00:46:37.350 --> 00:46:40.330
Insult me if you want. I'm going.

00:46:40.330 --> 00:46:43.000
You think you can get to Akane on your own?

00:46:43.000 --> 00:46:46.820
Rescue me, and I'll guide you to her.

00:46:46.820 --> 00:46:48.490
Really? You promise!?

00:46:48.490 --> 00:46:51.980
Women never break their word!

00:46:51.980 --> 00:46:53.950
Can I talk, now?

00:46:53.950 --> 00:46:54.950
Be my guest.

00:46:54.950 --> 00:46:58.790
The promise can only be kept if you defeat me!

00:46:59.700 --> 00:47:02.920
Sarutoru Ultimate Attack: SHADOW FALL!

00:47:04.210 --> 00:47:05.050
W-What!?

00:47:06.420 --> 00:47:11.270
You can't escape! This numbs your entire nervous system!

00:47:14.150 --> 00:47:17.070
Even standing must be difficult!

00:47:17.070 --> 00:47:18.270
Ryoga!

00:47:18.270 --> 00:47:19.640
Akane!

00:47:19.640 --> 00:47:20.900
Ryoga!?

00:47:20.900 --> 00:47:22.410
R-Ranma!

00:47:22.410 --> 00:47:23.900
What are you here for?

00:47:23.900 --> 00:47:26.150
"What"? I-I just came to...

00:47:26.150 --> 00:47:30.550
I finally got Ranma alone! I don't need YOU to butt in!

00:47:30.550 --> 00:47:32.660
I HATE you, Ryoga!

00:47:34.610 --> 00:47:38.700
I-am-so-miserable!

00:47:39.210 --> 00:47:40.460
It's over!

00:47:41.650 --> 00:47:44.960
I've reached the depths of desolation.

00:47:46.180 --> 00:47:46.880
W-What's this!?

00:47:47.420 --> 00:47:49.840
You should never have made me unhappy!

00:47:49.840 --> 00:47:53.300
Take this! LION'S ROAR ATTACK...!

00:48:03.570 --> 00:48:05.900
See that, Monkey Brains?

00:48:09.070 --> 00:48:09.740
Ryoga!

00:48:11.510 --> 00:48:13.640
Ryoga! Ryoga!

00:48:14.370 --> 00:48:15.460
Akane?

00:48:15.460 --> 00:48:18.870
Hang in there! Let's go find Akane, okay?

00:48:18.870 --> 00:48:21.370
I always gotta help you out.

00:48:21.370 --> 00:48:23.880
A fine thing to say after I rescued you.

00:48:23.880 --> 00:48:26.380
Big talk, Mr. Lost Child.

00:48:29.890 --> 00:48:33.960
It's no good. I'll never open it without the key.

00:48:35.400 --> 00:48:37.260
Where the heck is that little brat!?

00:48:37.260 --> 00:48:40.140
Ranma! Listen, the spring is just below...

00:48:40.910 --> 00:48:42.850
So there you are, y'smart-mouthed punk!

00:48:42.850 --> 00:48:46.690
Entering my chambers without my permission, and insulting me!

00:48:46.690 --> 00:48:48.110
Have you no shame?

00:48:48.110 --> 00:48:51.300
Shut up! That's what I want!

00:48:51.300 --> 00:48:55.120
You ask the impossible. I will give Akane to no one!

00:48:55.120 --> 00:48:58.160
Especially not to a hoodlum like you!

00:49:01.260 --> 00:49:04.390
No! He can't be your fiancé?!

00:49:05.260 --> 00:49:07.840
That's none of your business...

00:49:09.030 --> 00:49:11.950
If words are useless, then I'll just use force!

00:49:11.950 --> 00:49:13.880
What are you after?

00:49:15.720 --> 00:49:21.560
So you were after the gourd. If you want it, it's yours.

00:49:22.250 --> 00:49:26.110
All right! Now I can be a full-time man again!

00:49:27.350 --> 00:49:30.750
Huh? It's empty! Think you can fool me?

00:49:32.070 --> 00:49:34.070
Where's the water that was in there?

00:49:34.070 --> 00:49:36.970
The water of the spring is the treasure of Togenkyo Island.

00:49:36.970 --> 00:49:39.990
You will not learn its location that easily.

00:49:40.460 --> 00:49:43.000
You don't want an all-out fight, do you?

00:49:43.000 --> 00:49:45.960
Interesting! Show me what you mean by "all-out."

00:49:45.960 --> 00:49:47.670
Take this!

00:49:52.640 --> 00:49:55.760
I can't believe it! He turned my attack against me!

00:49:55.760 --> 00:49:57.030
One more time!

00:49:57.030 --> 00:50:01.070
Don't try it. Your punches can't touch me.

00:50:01.070 --> 00:50:02.560
Don't talk big!

00:50:07.360 --> 00:50:09.770
Damn! Is this more of his illusions?

00:50:09.770 --> 00:50:13.030
Do you understand the difference in our skills?

00:50:13.030 --> 00:50:14.990
You should simply surrender and leave.

00:50:14.990 --> 00:50:18.750
Can't do that! Not until I get that water!

00:50:18.750 --> 00:50:21.020
Are you still harping on that?

00:50:21.020 --> 00:50:23.290
Then I'll teach you another lesson!

00:50:23.290 --> 00:50:26.000
Feel the ultimate illusionary secret technique...

00:50:26.000 --> 00:50:30.000
I get it! He's creatin' illusions from the light of the sword!

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:34.370
Ranma! Stop it! I like you just the way you are!

00:50:34.370 --> 00:50:36.420
Don't fight anymore!

00:50:37.220 --> 00:50:40.370
Akane, I'm not gonna lose! Believe in me!

00:50:40.370 --> 00:50:41.180
Ranma!

00:50:41.180 --> 00:50:45.600
Enough talk! This is the end! Chaotic Mirage Attack!

00:50:49.000 --> 00:50:50.820
Regret your actions in the next life.

00:50:50.820 --> 00:50:51.420
Come off it!

00:50:51.420 --> 00:50:53.480
What!?

00:50:53.480 --> 00:50:55.550
Can't fool me with the same trick twice.

00:50:55.550 --> 00:50:59.790
It's just an illusion! If I can focus on that, I can take it!

00:50:59.790 --> 00:51:03.910
You can't! No one has been able to withstand it!

00:51:03.910 --> 00:51:06.370
Then what about THIS?

00:51:18.430 --> 00:51:20.420
A-Akane! You can't...

00:51:22.170 --> 00:51:24.470
Toma... Forgive me!

00:51:24.470 --> 00:51:27.200
Akane! What are you doing!?

00:51:29.740 --> 00:51:33.480
Come this way, Ranma! The spring is just below us!

00:51:33.480 --> 00:51:36.030
What? Really, Akane?

00:51:36.030 --> 00:51:37.650
Akane!

00:51:38.750 --> 00:51:40.720
Ranma!

00:51:43.850 --> 00:51:45.320
Akane!

00:51:50.360 --> 00:51:52.460
I've got more than just illusions!

00:51:54.070 --> 00:51:55.260
Ranma!

00:51:57.880 --> 00:51:59.220
Akane!

00:51:59.220 --> 00:52:01.520
I will not give Akane to anyone!

00:52:01.520 --> 00:52:04.010
And certainly not to YOU!

00:52:09.210 --> 00:52:11.910
Oh, man!

00:52:22.110 --> 00:52:24.530
Ranma! Get out of the way!

00:52:24.990 --> 00:52:27.490
Ranma!

00:52:28.450 --> 00:52:31.210
Doesn't he ever give up? I'll do it again!

00:52:31.210 --> 00:52:33.400
Stop it!

00:52:34.210 --> 00:52:36.130
Jeez! Outta my way, Akane!

00:52:36.130 --> 00:52:37.380
What?

00:52:41.650 --> 00:52:44.550
I hate people who don't give up!

00:52:45.510 --> 00:52:47.840
Stop it! Both of you, stop!

00:52:52.020 --> 00:52:54.190
Akane!

00:52:55.560 --> 00:52:56.910
Oh, no...

00:52:56.910 --> 00:52:59.900
Akane, there is no one to stand in our way!

00:52:59.900 --> 00:53:02.650
Have you decided to stay with me?

00:53:02.650 --> 00:53:05.820
I can't, Toma. I believe in Ranma.

00:53:05.820 --> 00:53:09.660
I know he'll come to save me. So, please forgive me...

00:53:09.660 --> 00:53:12.340
How can you trust him so much?

00:53:15.780 --> 00:53:17.910
Ranma!

00:53:18.980 --> 00:53:22.550
Nobody's gonna take Akane from me! Akane is my...

00:53:22.550 --> 00:53:24.910
...Fiancé!

00:53:31.160 --> 00:53:33.290
Akane!

00:53:34.300 --> 00:53:35.650
That's the spring!?

00:53:35.650 --> 00:53:37.920
Now you can be cured!

00:53:37.920 --> 00:53:40.150
Not anymore, I can't.

00:53:40.150 --> 00:53:41.790
I gotta destroy it!

00:53:41.790 --> 00:53:44.400
No! If you do, then you'll...

00:53:45.180 --> 00:53:47.990
Didn't you say you liked me the way I am?

00:53:47.990 --> 00:53:48.910
But...

00:53:48.910 --> 00:53:51.700
And the woman you are is the one I lo...

00:53:51.700 --> 00:53:52.910
I gotta destroy it!

00:53:52.910 --> 00:53:55.870
Ranma!

00:53:55.870 --> 00:53:59.500
I gotta risk all my strength on this one attack!

00:53:59.500 --> 00:54:01.650
Do it! Destroy it!

00:54:03.010 --> 00:54:04.880
Now!!

00:54:27.920 --> 00:54:30.700
Akane!? Where are you!? Akane!

00:54:30.700 --> 00:54:31.940
Right here, Ranma!

00:54:31.940 --> 00:54:33.180
You okay?

00:54:34.290 --> 00:54:36.210
Thank you, Ranma...

00:54:37.710 --> 00:54:40.490
You were saying back there...

00:54:41.470 --> 00:54:43.590
Look at that, Akane!

00:54:50.610 --> 00:54:53.020
Thank heavens you're both safe!

00:54:53.020 --> 00:54:56.140
Sorry! We didn't mean to worry you.

00:54:57.050 --> 00:55:00.530
Forgive me, Akane. I've learned something important.

00:55:00.530 --> 00:55:03.970
To love someone, you must place your loved one's feelings first.

00:55:03.970 --> 00:55:06.670
I'll have to start over.

00:55:06.670 --> 00:55:09.870
So, you're givin' up on Akane?

00:55:09.870 --> 00:55:12.660
Yes. I can't rival you, Ranma.

00:55:13.740 --> 00:55:17.010
Even without me, you made the right choice.

00:55:17.010 --> 00:55:20.160
You're better off without this stubborn tomboy...

00:55:22.370 --> 00:55:26.220
You're still young. I'm sure you'll find a wonderful bride.

00:55:26.220 --> 00:55:27.760
Thank you.

00:55:27.760 --> 00:55:29.910
Take care.

00:55:31.680 --> 00:55:33.800
What could've gotten into that smart-mouthed brat?

00:55:33.800 --> 00:55:36.170
Fallin' in love with a girl like that!

00:55:36.170 --> 00:55:38.310
I'm sorry, Ranma!

00:55:39.690 --> 00:55:42.150
You destroyed the spring to save me...

00:55:44.480 --> 00:55:46.820
You what!?

00:55:48.130 --> 00:55:51.050
Is this true about destroying the spring?

00:55:51.050 --> 00:55:52.880
Explain yourself, Ranma!

00:55:52.880 --> 00:55:55.490
Your fate depends on your answer!

00:55:55.490 --> 00:55:56.620
Don't worry!

00:55:56.620 --> 00:56:00.190
The spring came from a pool of sap from the sacred tree.

00:56:00.190 --> 00:56:04.090
In a few hundred years, it'll be as good as new.

00:56:04.090 --> 00:56:06.100
"Few hundred years"?

00:56:06.100 --> 00:56:08.200
What'll we do now, Daddy?

00:56:08.200 --> 00:56:10.850
We can't swim back...

00:56:11.460 --> 00:56:16.570
This is a floating island, going north on the Kuroshio current.

00:56:16.570 --> 00:56:20.020
We should be in Japan in about a week.

00:56:20.020 --> 00:56:23.050
Great! One more week of vacation!

00:56:23.050 --> 00:56:24.650
Actually, I've kind of gotten to like this outfit.

00:56:24.650 --> 00:56:28.050
Yeah! We can't get away with wearing this in Japan.

00:56:28.050 --> 00:56:32.100
Japan... I'll try to find a bride as nice as Akane there!
